WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.035
-Now, Magic, you spent
your career in the sports world

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:05.438
both on and off the court
and you have an eye for spotting

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.673
the best talent
for any given situation.

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:10.076
So we're going to play a new
game where you do just that.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.945
It's time for
"First Draft Pick."

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:12.912
Here we go.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:17.350
♪ -First draft pick ♪

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.617
♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:20.053
-Alright, bud. Here we go.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.690
First up, who would you rather
get into an Uber pool with?

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.459
Stephen A. Smith
or Charles Barkley?

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:29.361
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:31.931
-Well, if I got in
with Stephen A. Smith,

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.767
I wouldn't get a word in
edgewise.

00:00:34.767 --> 00:00:37.870
So I'm probably gonna go
with Charles Barkley.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.138
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Okay. Alright.

00:00:39.138 --> 00:00:42.141
That's a good answer.
-And remember this, Jimmy.

00:00:42.141 --> 00:00:45.444
With both of us, it's got to be
a big Uber car now.

00:00:45.444 --> 00:00:47.146
[ Laughter ]
-With Charles and Magic in it...

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:48.981
-I was going to say, Stephen --
-...can't be no little car.

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:51.518
-Stephen will fit in
a little bit easier, but okay.

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:53.052
I see what's up.

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:56.289
Okay. You need to
deliver a rousing pep talk

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:58.091
to your Pee Wee football team.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:01.861
Will it be
Leslie Jones or Lisa Leslie?

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:05.832
-I'm going with Lisa Leslie
'cause I know she's a champion

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:09.635
and she will deliver
a great speech.

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:12.538
She's smart
and a good friend of mine.

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:14.039
So I'm gonna go
with Lisa Leslie.

00:01:14.039 --> 00:01:15.808
-Alright. Oh, this is a good one
right here.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.143
Magic, you're on the road.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:18.644
You got to order pizza.

00:01:18.644 --> 00:01:20.580
Domino's or Pizza Hut?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:23.148
-Oh, man, that's easy.
Domino's all day long.

00:01:23.148 --> 00:01:25.518
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Wow! Come on! What?!

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:28.454
Oh, even my audience?!
What are you talking about?!

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:30.590
You got to go with the Hut!
-Nah, Domino's all day.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.592
-Oh, my God!
-All day, man.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:35.528
-You're in court,
contesting a parking ticket.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:40.133
Who do you want as your lawyer,
Phil Jackson or Bobby Knight?

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.401
-Well, wow!

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:44.537
Because Bobby Knight
would cuss everybody out.

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.537
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.537 --> 00:01:47.573
And Phil Jackson
is really smart.

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:50.910
So I'm gonna take Phil Jackson
'cause he's gonna get me off.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.812
I know Phil Jackson
will get me off.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.113
-Yeah, Phil Jackson
will get you off,

00:01:54.113 --> 00:01:56.516
but Bobby Knight might
throw a chair or something.

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:58.584
Do we have a video?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.584 --> 00:01:59.452
Here's my man.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.621
Hey!
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:04.057
That's my jam.

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.792
Oh, this is an interesting one
here, Magic.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:09.228
You can only wear one type of
shirt for the rest of your life.

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:11.564
Turtlenecks or V-necks?

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.099
-Wow!

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:15.635
And, you know,
I'm a fashion dude, too.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:17.470
-I think I know the answer.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.706
I'm gonna circle it.
I think I know your answer.

00:02:19.706 --> 00:02:22.275
-I'm going to go with, though...

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:23.909
Turtlenecks. I'm going to
go with turtlenecks.

00:02:23.909 --> 00:02:25.912
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes! Check it out!

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:29.215
I said -- I knew turtlenecks.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.616
Alright, this one's a tough one.

00:02:30.616 --> 00:02:32.452
You have to play one song

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:34.487
to pump up a crowd
at a Lakers game.

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:37.723
Do you choose "I Love L.A."
by Randy Newman

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:40.260
or "California Love" by Tupac?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.595
-Oh, you know,
"California Love," Tupac.

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:44.330
Dang, man.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:47.099
I got to go with Tupac
all day long.

00:02:47.099 --> 00:02:48.968
That's my man.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:52.104
The greatest
that's ever done it.

00:02:52.104 --> 00:02:54.607
Hey, it's like your band,
the Roots, over there.

00:02:54.607 --> 00:02:56.409
They're the best
that's ever done it.

00:02:56.409 --> 00:03:01.147
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:01.147 --> 00:03:05.451
-Well, they have a good [Clears
throat] teammate as well.

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:08.654
You know? It's like --
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:10.656
Alright. Last question.

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:13.392
You're down by 2 with 2 seconds
left in the game.

00:03:13.392 --> 00:03:15.194
Who do you want
taking the last shot?

00:03:15.194 --> 00:03:16.529
LeBron or K.D.?

00:03:16.529 --> 00:03:18.097
-Oh, man!

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:20.633
-This is going to
rock the sports world.

00:03:20.633 --> 00:03:23.169
This is going to
rock the sports world.

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:25.104
-Yikes!

00:03:25.104 --> 00:03:27.406
Oh, man!

00:03:27.406 --> 00:03:32.611
Now, you know K.D. is a scorer
and one of the greatest

00:03:32.611 --> 00:03:34.313
that we've ever seen
at that position.

00:03:34.313 --> 00:03:36.282
But I got to ride the winner,
too.

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:41.454
I got to ride LeBron because he
got more championships than K.D.

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:43.789
-Wow! That's unbelievable!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:43.789 --> 00:03:45.424
You heard it here first.

00:03:45.424 --> 00:03:46.892
Magic, you're the best, buddy.

00:03:46.892 --> 00:03:48.428
It's always great to see you.
-You too, my friend.

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.763
-That was "First Draft Pick."
My thanks to Magic Johnson.

